151
00:14:16.458 --> 00:14:19.666
Not only did I feel insecure,
because they were staring at me.

152
00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:23.375
I was suffocating. My heart was pounding.

153
00:14:23.458 --> 00:14:25.791
I didn't feel alive at all.

154
00:14:47.458 --> 00:14:52.708
And just like that
I ruined the most important day

155
00:14:53.208 --> 00:14:55.041
