194
00:17:55.083 --> 00:17:56.291
In Cielo.

195
00:18:23.208 --> 00:18:24.625
KENJI SENT A VIDEO

196
00:18:32.875 --> 00:18:38.333
Gosh, by watching stuff like that
I might like jazz more than rock.

197
00:18:38.833 --> 00:18:40.750
Hiro!

198
00:18:48.791 --> 00:18:50.708
He really is divine.

199
00:19:08.541 --> 00:19:09.583
Head!

200
00:20:35.291 --> 00:20:38.666
Kendo lessons were mine
best decision!

201
00:20:43.375 --> 00:20:46.791
Fear is particularly visible
before physical contact.

202
00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:53.166
If it affects your daily life
and relationships, as in your case,

203
00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:56.000
It's very possible that it's obsessive-compulsive disorder.

204
00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:58.291
You don't shake anyone's hand, do you?

205
00:20:58.375 --> 00:21:02.208
I thought you were a healer,
and yet you are a real doctor.

206
00:21:02.291 --> 00:21:04.500
Now I understand.

207
00:21:04.583 --> 00:21:09.041
In college you were the only guy
who rejected me.

208
00:21:09.916 --> 00:21:13.916
You were pretending, weren't you? That's all
self-confidence and unapproachability.

209
00:21:14.416 --> 00:21:15.333
Listen.

210
00:21:15.416 --> 00:21:18.250
I never sleep
with the same guy twice.

211
00:21:18.333 --> 00:21:19.875
You still have a chance, Sosuke.

212
00:21:19.958 --> 00:21:21.583
Good luck with your therapy.

213
00:21:21.666 --> 00:21:23.333
Forget about therapy.

214
00:21:23.416 --> 00:21:25.833
Issue a piece of paper saying I can work.

215
00:21:25.916 --> 00:21:27.666
Without any therapy

216
00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:30.541
