and whom they love.

264
00:23:55.041 --> 00:23:58.291
Let's make this day a reason to be proud.

265
00:23:59.166 --> 00:24:02.333
With all my heart, today and always…

266
00:24:02.416 --> 00:24:04.333
With all my heart.

267
00:24:04.416 --> 00:24:06.125
Let's give it our all.

268
00:24:06.625 --> 00:24:08.208
We will do our best.

269
00:24:11.375 --> 00:24:12.541
