Hello. Mrs. Kuroiwa with a reservation?

276
00:24:48.041 --> 00:24:48.875
Yes.

277
00:24:48.958 --> 00:24:51.666
Can I take your coat?

278
00:24:53.250 --> 00:24:54.333
Sorry.

279
00:24:54.416 --> 00:24:55.875
Do you have anything in your coat?

280
00:24:55.958 --> 00:24:56.833
NO.

281
00:24:57.416 --> 00:24:58.291
This way, please.

282
00:24:58.375 --> 00:25:00.541
Thank you.

283
00:25:02.583 --> 00:25:03.583
Yes.

284
00:25:03.666 --> 00:25:05.583
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

285
00:25:05.666 --> 00:25:06.791
Please.

286
00:25:06.875 --> 00:25:07.708
Yes.

287
00:25:39.083 --> 00:25:39.916
Gosh.

288
00:25:43.541 --> 00:25:45.583
Boss, where are you?

289
00:25:46.083 --> 00:25:49.250
I really can't stay here anymore.

290
00:25:49.333 --> 00:25:54.250
I sent you one instead
Valentine's Day gift.

291
00:25:54.333 --> 00:25:55.750
Isn't there yet?

292
00:25:55.833 --> 00:25:58.375
He'll definitely show up soon.

293
00:26:01.250 --> 00:26:02.083
What?

294
00:26:03.333 --> 00:26:04.166
Gift?

295
00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:06.291
What did you do?

296
00:26:06.375 --> 00:26:08.875
No way. Absolutely not!

297
00:26:08.958 --> 00:26:11.208
- I can't!
- Listen.

298
00:26:11.291 --> 00:26:14.833
Without making eye contact
you can fall in love too.

299
00:26:14.916 --> 00:26:16.500
Just be next to him.

300
00:26:17.333 --> 00:26:19.375
Wait a minute.

301
00:26:20.208 --> 00:26:22.125
Boss?

302
00:26:30.541 --> 00:26:33.250
- I told you I couldn't do it!
- Hello?

303
00:26:33.333 --> 00:26:36.625
Boss Kenji gave me your number,

304
00:26:36.708 --> 00:26:38.750
so I'm calling.

305
00:27:04.666 --> 00:27:05.833
Oh no.

306
00:27:05.916 --> 00:27:06.750
Sorry.

307
00:27:06.833 --> 00:27:08.875
- These flowers have...
- This way.

308
00:27:08.958 --> 00:27:09.875
- This way.
- This way?

309
00:27:09.958 --> 00:27:11.166
- This way.
- What?

310
00:27:11.250 --> 00:27:14.083
- Please take them to the entrance.
- All right.

311
00:27:14.166 --> 00:27:15.583
- This way.
- All right.

312
00:27:16.083 --> 00:27:17.791
- Thank you.
- No problem.

313
00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:30.958
My coat.

314
00:27:40.708 --> 00:27:41.541
I'm cold!

315
00:28:12.291 --> 00:28:14.291
Why don't you answer?

316
00:28:14.833 --> 00:28:16.625
Are you mad at me?

317
00:28:17.750 --> 00:28:20.375
I hate myself for this too
what I am like.

318
00:28:20.875 --> 00:28:24.500
But I'm really good with it
that I am alone.

319
00:28:28.000 --> 00:28:28.833
Oh?

320
00:28:30.250 --> 00:28:31.666
Black Forest cake?

321
00:28:32.166 --> 00:28:33.333
It's too obvious!

322
00:28:34.083 --> 00:28:36.625
It's my birthday cake, right?

323
00:28:48.583 --> 00:28:49.708
Boss?

324
00:28:50.916 --> 00:28:52.958
Boss? Boss!

325
00:28:53.458 --> 00:28:54.750
What happened, boss?

326
00:28:54.833 --> 00:28:55.666
Boss!

327
00:28:55.750 --> 00:28:58.583
Boss. Wake up!

328
00:28:59.958 --> 00:29:01.208
What should I do?

329
00:29:06.958 --> 00:29:09.500
He fell and is unconscious.

330
00:29:09.583 --> 00:29:11.125
Please help him!

331
00:29:11.875 --> 00:29:13.791
Savior Confectionery.

332
00:29:13.875 --> 00:29:15.833
Hurry up. I'm begging you!

333
00:29:17.083 --> 00:29:20.000
Boss!

334
00:29:21.000 --> 00:29:24.916
Boss…

335
00:29:25.000 --> 00:29:27.041
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, HANA

336
00:29:27.125 --> 00:29:28.791
What should I do?

337
00:30:50.666 --> 00:30:51.500
Please.

338
00:30:52.708 --> 00:30:55.916
Sorry. Do you have a moment?

339
00:30:56.000 --> 00:30:57.083
Bright.

340
00:30:59.916 --> 00:31:04.416
Are you really planning on taking over the Savior?

341
00:31:05.708 --> 00:31:09.833
Kenji's widow
needs the support of Futago Sweets.

342
00:31:11.000 --> 00:31:13.791
And the brand and image of the Savior

343
00:31:14.750 --> 00:31:16.625
they are of great value to us.

344
00:31:18.083 --> 00:31:19.375
Then…

345
00:31:21.958 --> 00:31:24.750
Could you trust me
Savior management?

346
00:31:24.833 --> 00:31:26.791
I can't.

347
00:31:28.125 --> 00:31:33.458
If the heir of Futago Sweets
will manage it and will suffer a loss,

348
00:31:33.958 --> 00:31:36.208
we could lose our image.

349
00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:40.958
I think you can
more to gain than to lose.

350
00:31:43.333 --> 00:31:46.583
SAVIOR
SUGGESTED STORE EDITION

351
00:31:46.666 --> 00:31:50.583
Even without Boss Kenji
his techniques and recipes live on.

352
00:31:51.291 --> 00:31:54.083
To perfect Futago chocolates,

353
00:31:54.166 --> 00:31:57.250
I'm going to find out
about the Savior of all.

354
00:31:59.166 --> 00:32:01.000
Futago Sweets Company

355
00:32:01.083 --> 00:32:05.208
donated some
Mrs. Fumiko's shares,

356
00:32:05.291 --> 00:32:07.291
widow of the late Kenji Kuroiwa.

357
00:32:07.916 --> 00:32:13.208
Ms. Fumiko now owns 1.25% of the shares
at Słodycze Futago,

358
00:32:13.291 --> 00:32:18.583
and Futago Sweets
acquired 51% of the shares of Cukiernia Wybawica.

359
00:32:19.166 --> 00:32:23.791
Therefore, as the new owners of the Savior

360
00:32:24.500 --> 00:32:28.625
we will make every effort,
to restore the bakery's operations.

361
00:32:28.708 --> 00:32:31.166
Director Sosuke Fujiwara stated,

362
00:32:31.250 --> 00:32:34.708
that introducing the Savior
under the wings of Futago Sweets,

363
00:32:34.791 --> 00:32:37.250
they expect further business development.

364
00:32:45.208 --> 00:32:48.750
BUTTERFLY HUG

365
00:32:50.541 --> 00:32:52.541
TRY

366
00:33:23.208 --> 00:33:24.958
Dear Dr. Irene.

367
00:33:30.333 --> 00:33:31.500
Good evening.

368
00:33:32.125 --> 00:33:36.875
I currently struggle with severe scopophobia

369
00:33:36.958 --> 00:33:40.583
and I avoid contact with other people.

370
00:33:41.458 --> 00:33:46.958
But I don't want to drive anymore
such a lonely life.

371
00:33:48.208 --> 00:33:51.333
So I gathered my courage,
to write this message.

372
00:33:52.625 --> 00:33:53.916
Mom.

373
00:33:55.375 --> 00:34:01.875
There's no one left for me to look at
face to face and who I could talk to.

374
00:34:01.958 --> 00:34:03.083
Mom.

375
00:34:10.708 --> 00:34:12.333
Mom.

376
00:34:30.750 --> 00:34:33.416
WILL YOU WORK WITH ME?

377
00:34:39.083 --> 00:34:42.125
After my mother died

378
00:34:42.208 --> 00:34:44.708
I stopped taking treatment.

379
00:34:45.458 --> 00:34:50.125
I thought I could do just fine on my own.

380
00:34:50.916 --> 00:34:54.208
But I finally understood

381
00:34:54.833 --> 00:34:57.833
that she did nothing
I am unable to do so.

382
00:34:58.541 --> 00:35:01.166
Now that I'm really alone

383
00:35:01.250 --> 00:35:05.166
the thought of being alone terrifies me.

384
00:35:05.250 --> 00:35:06.458
If possible,

385
00:35:06.541 --> 00:35:09.875
I would like to start therapy anonymously.

386
00:35:17.041 --> 00:35:18.000
They came.

387
00:35:26.166 --> 00:35:28.500
Nice to meet you.

388
00:35:29.375 --> 00:35:33.583
From now on, I will manage the Savior.

389
00:35:33.666 --> 00:35:37.416
I'm Sosuke Fujiwara, the new president.

390
00:35:41.416 --> 00:35:46.000
To resume operations,
I am asking everyone for support.

391
00:35:47.583 --> 00:35:52.458
I heard Chief Kenji greeted you
always with the same words.

392
00:35:53.583 --> 00:35:55.083
With all my heart

393
00:35:55.666 --> 00:35:58.708
I look forward to cooperation
with all of you.

394
00:36:01.791 --> 00:36:04.041
We look forward to working with you.

395
00:36:08.458 --> 00:36:10.500
Dear Anonymous Chocolatier,

396
00:36:11.000 --> 00:36:15.458
I work hard
to get the Savior back on his feet.

397
00:36:15.541 --> 00:36:20.833
I am aware of your cooperation
is necessary to achieve this goal.

398
00:36:20.916 --> 00:36:25.000
“That's why I would be grateful
for your cooperation.

399
00:36:25.750 --> 00:36:30.625
Can we arrange a meeting
at your earliest convenience?”

400
00:36:42.541 --> 00:36:44.916
As for Chocolatier Anonymous,

401
00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:48.500
I'm going to meet him
and terminate the contract.

402
00:36:48.583 --> 00:36:52.000
At the same time, I want to
receive recipes from him.

403
00:36:52.083 --> 00:36:56.041
I am asking for your cooperation towards this goal
ensuring production safety

404
00:36:56.125 --> 00:36:57.958
chocolates from these recipes.

405
00:36:58.833 --> 00:36:59.958
What?

406
00:37:04.041 --> 00:37:06.083
Is there any problem?

407
00:37:07.250 --> 00:37:08.250
No, sir.

408
00:37:09.500 --> 00:37:11.375
So thank you for your support.

409
00:37:13.125 --> 00:37:17.666
Boss Kenji has always protected his identity and role

410
00:37:17.750 --> 00:37:19.458
Anonymous Chocolatier.

411
00:37:19.541 --> 00:37:22.333
Could you please reconsider
termination of the contract?

412
00:37:22.833 --> 00:37:23.875
Please.

413
00:37:24.375 --> 00:37:26.375
I understand, ma'am.

414
00:37:27.041 --> 00:37:29.833
However, Futago Sweets
they cannot accept

415
00:37:30.333 --> 00:37:33.000
maintaining a contract with an unknown party.

416
00:37:53.583 --> 00:37:58.208
I'm fine.

417
00:37:58.833 --> 00:38:00.208
I'll be fine.

418
00:38:06.333 --> 00:38:10.833
EMPLOYEES WANTED

419
00:38:15.791 --> 00:38:16.875
Hello.

420
00:38:16.958 --> 00:38:18.583
Sorry.

421
00:38:19.541 --> 00:38:22.375
"Difference of opinion"?
Why should you be the one to leave, Mom?

422
00:38:22.458 --> 00:38:24.166
I don't understand!

423
00:38:24.250 --> 00:38:25.750
If there is a conflict,

424
00:38:25.833 --> 00:38:29.833
this or Anonymous Chocolat
shouldn't he be fired first?

425
00:38:31.416 --> 00:38:32.250
Oh.

426
00:38:33.250 --> 00:38:34.333
Sorry.

427
00:38:34.916 --> 00:38:37.583
We have no plans to open Savior right now.

428
00:38:37.666 --> 00:38:40.458
I am not a customer.

429
00:38:42.041 --> 00:38:43.125
I'm working…

430
00:38:45.250 --> 00:38:46.375
I mean…

431
00:38:47.875 --> 00:38:49.583
For a long time…

432
00:38:52.750 --> 00:38:53.625
Actually, I…

433
00:38:53.708 --> 00:38:54.541
Oh?

434
00:38:55.625 --> 00:38:57.125
Are you applying for a job?

435
00:38:57.750 --> 00:38:58.625
Yes!

436
00:38:59.833 --> 00:39:00.666
What?

437
00:39:02.666 --> 00:39:03.500
I invite.

438
00:39:04.041 --> 00:39:05.625
- Have you heard?
- What?

439
00:39:05.708 --> 00:39:07.333
Are they already hiring?

440
00:39:07.416 --> 00:39:08.250
Impossible.

441
00:39:08.333 --> 00:39:12.083
So you have no experience?

442
00:39:13.875 --> 00:39:15.875
What did you do before?

443
00:39:15.958 --> 00:39:16.791
Yes.

444
00:39:17.625 --> 00:39:20.166
For a long time…

445
00:39:21.916 --> 00:39:24.750
I was kind of NEET.

446
00:39:24.833 --> 00:39:26.000
Sorry.

447
00:39:26.500 --> 00:39:28.125
Someone like me…

448
00:39:28.625 --> 00:39:29.958
I mean,

449
00:39:30.041 --> 00:39:31.291
I'm not suitable, right?

450
00:39:31.791 --> 00:39:32.750
Then…

451
00:39:33.416 --> 00:39:34.916
Why did you come?

452
00:39:35.750 --> 00:39:37.958
How do you know this store?

453
00:39:38.750 --> 00:39:41.250
Well…

454
00:39:47.791 --> 00:39:49.125
The point is

455
00:39:50.708 --> 00:39:52.291
that I am…

456
00:39:58.833 --> 00:40:01.000
I probably ate it

457
00:40:02.750 --> 00:40:04.541
about 10,000 chocolates from here.

458
00:40:05.750 --> 00:40:08.541
When my heart hurt,

459
00:40:09.250 --> 00:40:12.000
chocolates from this store comforted me.

460
00:40:13.791 --> 00:40:15.166
Thanks to them

461
00:40:16.416 --> 00:40:17.625
for a while…

462
00:40:20.500 --> 00:40:23.416
I felt happy.

463
00:40:25.125 --> 00:40:26.083
Heart?

464
00:40:27.208 --> 00:40:29.333
I only have this.

465
00:40:30.708 --> 00:40:31.541
Then…

466
00:40:32.208 --> 00:40:33.541
Gentlemen, forgive me.

467
00:40:35.333 --> 00:40:37.041
- I'm accepting you.
- Yes.

468
00:40:38.541 --> 00:40:39.583
I'm listening?

469
00:40:40.500 --> 00:40:42.458
She didn't even bring her CV.

470
00:40:42.958 --> 00:40:45.708
We need someone to start right away.

471
00:40:45.791 --> 00:40:48.291
Please work with all your heart

472
00:40:48.375 --> 00:40:50.875
in a new position as a waitress.

473
00:40:51.791 --> 00:40:52.875
I'm listening?

474
00:40:52.958 --> 00:40:54.208
- This way.
- What?

475
00:41:19.666 --> 00:41:24.041
NO. I can't do it.

476
00:41:25.708 --> 00:41:27.083
Did something happen?

477
00:41:28.083 --> 00:41:29.375
An dwaeyo.

478
00:41:30.291 --> 00:41:31.291
“An dwaeyo”?

479
00:41:31.375 --> 00:41:33.250
I can't do it!

480
00:41:33.791 --> 00:41:35.916
- That means...
- Wait.

481
00:42:09.083 --> 00:42:11.291
One day you'll meet someone

482
00:42:12.291 --> 00:42:15.916
Who will you be able to look into the eyes of?
as long as you want.

483
00:42:17.500 --> 00:42:20.833
This is your soulmate.

484
00:42:23.458 --> 00:42:24.583
Or…

485
00:42:25.083 --> 00:42:30.208
dangerous villain,
that your instincts will warn you about.

486
00:42:30.875 --> 00:42:32.708
Really bad guy.

487
00:42:32.791 --> 00:42:34.000
Bad guy?

488
00:42:45.083 --> 00:42:45.916
What?

489
00:42:58.458 --> 00:42:59.791
Bad guy?

490
00:43:04.125 --> 00:43:04.958
What?

491
00:46:44.750 --> 00:46:49.750
Subtitles: Grzegorz Marczyk

